nt at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1067","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[55,59,78,77,75,83],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007302","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1027005"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1067","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[55,59,78,77,75,83],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"120","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007302","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1027005"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ1010002","city":"CS1067","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[55,59,78,77,75,83],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007302","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1027005"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"高句丽大臣、任沛者。魏将毌丘俭伐高句丽前，多次劝谏东川王高位宫未果，叹息‘立见此地将生蓬蒿’，遂绝食而死，全国百姓俱尊其为贤人。毌丘俭破高句丽时，特令保护其墓冢、释放家属。","tc":"高句麗大臣、任沛者。魏將毌丘儉伐高句麗前，多次勸諫東川王高位宮未果，嘆息‘立見此地將生蓬蒿’，遂絕食而死，全國百姓俱尊其為賢人。毌丘儉破高句麗時，特令保護其墓冢、釋放家屬。","en":"A minister of Goguryeo who held the rank of Peizhe. Before the Wei general Guanqiu Jian campaigned against Goguryeo, Delai repeatedly admonished King Dongcheon (Gao Weigong) without success. Sighing, ‘I shall soon see this land overgrown with wild weeds,’ he starved himself to death. The people throughout the land revered him as a sage. When Guanqiu Jian crushed Goguryeo, he issued special orders to protect Delai's tomb and release his family.","jp":"高句麗の大臣で、沛者の官にあった。魏将・毌丘倹が高句麗を討伐する前、東川王・高位宮を幾度も諫めるも容れられず、「すぐにこの地にも蓬蒿が生い茂るのを見ることになろう」と嘆息し、ついに絶食して没した。国中の民はみな彼を賢人として尊んだ。毌丘倹が高句麗を破った際には、その墓を保護し、家族を釈放するよう特に命じた。","kr":"고구려의 대신으로 패자(沛者)를 지냈습니다. 위나라 장수 관구검이 고구려를 침공하기 전, 동천왕 고위궁에게 수차례 간언했으나 받아들여지지 않자 '머지않아 이 땅에 쑥이 무성해지는 것을 보겠구나'라고 탄식하며 스스로 곡기를 끊고 목숨을 끊었습니다. 온 나라 백성이 그를 현인으로 받들었으며, 관구검이 고구려를 격파했을 때 특별히 명을 내려 그의 묘를 보호하고 가족들을 모두 방면하도록 했습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1053615","remark":"","surname":"","surnameTc":"","surnameEn":"","surnameJp":"","surnameKr":"","surnameOther":"","name":"得来","nameTc":"得來","nameEn":"Delai","nameJp":"得来","nameKr":"득래","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"得来","power":"WJ1010002","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1067","gender":"0","rule":"55","force":"59","wise":"78","politics":"77","charm":"75","will":"83","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"7","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"28/34/32/25/35/78/30/33","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"S1002605","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4900","battleSoulPoint":"5300","debateSoulPoint":"4600","strategy":"","strategy2":"1010601","professions":"2/2/3/2/0/0/2/0/1/0/1/2/1/0/1/1/2/3/2/2/0/3/1/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compatible":"70","loyalty":"120","reputation":"0","evaluate":"7000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"170","show":"184","death":"243","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"3","weapon":"WP1007302","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1027005","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"16/1;57/1;30/0;9/0;2/0;31/0;42/0;41/0;12/0;38/0;27/0;21/0","father":"","mother":"","children":"","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"","belief":"0","isVIP":"1","startVIPYear":"180","endVIPYear":"198","description":"高句丽大臣、任沛者。魏将毌丘俭伐高句丽前，多次劝谏东川王高位宫未果，叹息‘立见此地将生蓬蒿’，遂绝食而死，全国百姓俱尊其为贤人。毌丘俭破高句丽